    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38148" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανα-τέλλω</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαντέλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>raise,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδὸς ἴχνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					105
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. κέρας ἐκ μετώπου</span>”
				<i>send forth,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					2.97
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>rise,</i> [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἤλιον] ἐπανατεῖλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.142
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλίου ἐπανατείλαντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.84
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἐπανέτελλε ὁ ἥλιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.54
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαντέλλων ἀστράσιν ἠέλιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.178
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανατεταλκέτω τὸ</span> H
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				376b29
			</span></i>; of a star, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				2134.7
			</span></i>; <i>rise again,</i>
