				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ χάρακος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Aem.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			; <i>show oneself, appear,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκὰς δὲ κόρσας τῇδ᾽ ἐπαντέλλειν
