					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					1053
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐπαντέλλων
			χρόνος</span> the time <i>coming to light, the future,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				8.28
			</span></i>.</div>
